@startuml
' Opsy — UML component and data-flow architecture
' Visual contract: user-provided Shopify Operations Skill UML reference.
' Content authority: current Opsy repository only.
' Updated: 2026-09-13, Asia/Shanghai. Code/contracts, not live store evidence.

title
<size:28><b>Opsy — UML 组件与数据流架构图</b></size>
<size:16><color:#64748B>1 个注册 Skill · 3 项核心功能 / 6 个工作流 · CLI 授权恢复 · 本地数据 · 结果与任务续接</color></size>
end title

top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F6F9FC
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 48
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam defaultFontColor #17243A
